  "description": {
    "ja": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (ja): オウギヤシ",
      "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%AA%E3%82%A6%E3%82%AE%E3%83%A4%E3%82%B7",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 109044161,
      "text": "オウギヤシ、扇椰子 は、ヤシ科パルミラヤシ属に属する常緑高木。別名パルミラヤシ、シュガーパーム。原産は熱帯アフリカで、東南アジアからインド東部にかけて栽培されている。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Borassus flabellifer",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Borassus_flabellifer",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1376027455,
      "text": "Borassus flabellifer, also known as palmyra palm, is a fan palm native to tropical and sub-tropical regions of South Asia and Southeast Asia. It is a tall, sturdy tree growing up to 20–30 m (66–98 ft), with large fan-shaped leaves arranged in the form of a crown. It produces a pale white and branched inflorescence consisting of clusters of flowers. It produces bunches of large fruits containing sweet, watery kernels."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Borassus flabellifer",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Borassus_flabellifer",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 171582418,
      "text": "La palma de Palmira es una especie de plantas de la familia de las palmeras (Arecaceae)."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Palmier de Palmyre",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Palmier_de_Palmyre",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 235881826,
      "text": "Le palmier de Palmyre, aussi appelé palmier à sucre ou encore palmier à vin ou bien palmier rônier, est une espèce de plantes à fleurs de la famille des Arécacées. C'est un arbre tropical souvent cultivé en Asie du Sud et du Sud-Est à diverses fins et notamment pour la production de sucre."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Siwalan",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Siwalan",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 29291967,
      "text": "Siwalan juga dikenal dengan nama pohon lontar atau tal, adalah sejenis palma yang tumbuh di Asia Selatan dan Asia Tenggara. Di banyak daerah, pohon ini juga dikenal dengan nama-nama yang mirip seperti lonta (Min.), ental, taʼal (Md.), talaʼ (Mks.), taʼ (Bug.), dun tal (Sas.), jun tal (Sumbawa), lontara, lontoir (Ambon), koli. Juga manggita, manggitu, tua, noe (Nusa Tenggara Timur, dan fu'u ta'a."
    }
  },
